This repository is the Wave 1 baseline split from `monitor-poc/webhook/` during
the DatRail split (2026-07-20). The PoC collector that accompanied it was
removed at the split because it depended on monorepo-only paths; RailMon is the
component that produces the runtime interactions RailDash displays.
